        "title": "A note for the morning",
        "text": "Use Explore to visit the Quay cafe (7 min). Buy one Tea in Shops here. Mara often stops by after quarter past seven; wait if she is absent. Give a gift, then hear her warning in Explore. Carry the warning to the station, prepare the signal, then choose Light the honest signal. Listening to the tide at home is optional. Maps, menus and reading are free. If you miss Mara today, she returns each morning.",
